// KINGA — Sport Levels (v2: HubSpot industry-based)
// ═══════════════════════════════════════════
// REPLACES the v1 keyword pattern matcher (which defaulted everything to "D1").
// Now reads `industry` straight off customer_rep_map (seeded from HubSpot).
